grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">NA</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>आय प्रमाणपत्र, जाति प्रमाणपत्र, निवास प्रमाणपत्र सत्यापन</strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">NA</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">UP Income, Cast, Residential Certificate Online Apply &amp; Verification 2026</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;Which Certificate Verify&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Income Certificate</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Caste Certificate</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Domicile Certificate</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;Process for Search Old Certificate&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Enter Your Certificate 11 digit Code and Check the Status Link</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Enter the Certificate No. to Search Status of Certificate.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;Process for Search New Certificate&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Search Your New Certificate / E District Verification (12 Digit Code)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Click On the New Certificate Link. and after that fill in 12 digit code and then verify that’s original.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;Benefits of Online Certificate Verification&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">The process of verifying the UP Income, Caste, and Domicile Certificates is crucial to ensure that only eligible candidates receive the benefits and reservations. It plays a key role in preventing fraudulent or false claims, ensuring that deserving individuals are not denied their rightful entitlements.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;UP Online Certificate Verification Process&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">After obtaining the certificate, the candidate must upload it to the official UP Revenue Department website for verification. The website offers an online portal where the candidate can enter the necessary information and upload the required documents for the verification process.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Additionally, the website provides a tracking feature that allows the candidate to monitor the status of their certificate verification. To check the status, the candidate simply needs to enter their application number, date of birth, and the captcha code on the website.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">If the certificate is verified as valid and authentic, the candidate will receive a verification certificate. This certificate must be presented during the admission or recruitment process in order to access any associated benefits or reservations. On the other hand, if the certificate is determined to be invalid or fraudulent, the candidate could face legal consequences.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;Documents Required for UP Caste, Income Certificate Online Apply&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Aadhaar Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Ration Card (optional)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Voter ID / PAN Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Recent Passport Size Photo</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Caste Proof (family or relative’s old caste certificate)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Self-declaration form (download from portal)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Domicile Certificate of UP</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Income Certificate (for OBC creamy layer)</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #ffffff; background-color: #000080;\"><strong>&nbsp;How to Check Certificate Online&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates have to open the official website of bor.up.nic.in</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">And Click on BOR UP Certificate Verification Online 2026 Board of Revenue</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">And you will see All links for the Check All Certificate.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Click on Any Certificate.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">Enter your 11 or 12 Digit Certificate Code.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">That’s Done.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt; color: #000000;\">UP Income | Caste | Domicile Certificate Verification 2026 Last Date is NA</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nb